WEBVTT

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.080
Hey, Ard!

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.150
Let's go to that one next!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:09.900
Sure.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>Despite appearances,</i>

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.360
<i>we're currently patrolling the school.</i>

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.500
<i>All because of the threat from Lars al Ghoul.</i>

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.360
This frozen dessert is delicious.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.330
Oh, Miss Ireena.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.670
You have some syrup on your cheek.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:30.820
Huh?

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.800
Oh, you're right.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:38.300
<i>We're just pretending to enjoy the 
school festival to its fullest.</i>

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.260
I want to eat something else, too!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.930
Oh, then come stop by ours!

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.560
No, no, ours is putting 
out way tastier stuff!

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.600
It feels like a dream.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.600
I never thought I'd get along 
with everyone like this.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.280
<i>We certainly aren't just letting ourselves 
get excited as we go around to attractions.</i>

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.120
What's that?!

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.660
Hey!

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.000
You're acting suspicious!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.210
Now surrender and turn yourself in!

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.800
For now, let's go ask the idiot—

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.450
No, pardon me, let's go ask 
Miss Sylphy what's going on.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.050
What are you doing here?

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.890
This man is a demon!

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.480
I'm sure of it!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.730
No, no, no, I'm not!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.890
Most with eyes like yours are demons!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.310
Lower your sword! Please!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.110
Ah! Lady Olivia! Please help me!

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.320
This crazy girl is making 
baseless accusations

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.060
and trying to kill me!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.980
Hey, put the sword away.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.870
He's not a demon.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.840
He's staff at the restaurant I usually go to.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:56.570
The French fries he cooks up are exquisite,

00:01:56.570 --> 00:01:59.180
and I even apprenticed under him for a while.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:02.320
So I can vouch for his identity.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.440
<i>Exquisite French fries?</i>

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:05.800
<i>Apprenticed?</i>

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.080
<i>You were one of my top generals, right?</i>

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.970
<i>You went and learned how to fry potatoes?</i>

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.900
<i>Just how badly do you love potatoes?</i>

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:15.850
D-Did I go and do it again?

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:19.860
You don't need to join the patrols anymore.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.660
Why don't you go help our 
class with our attraction?

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:27.870
If you say so, Big Sis.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.860
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:37.000
It always feels strange 
looking at this tree,

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.510
no matter how often I see it.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.600
If I recall, the third king of Laville...

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.950
the man known as the Great Sword King

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:48.520
is said to have sealed something 
special here in this spot.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.520
I doubt I'm the only one who's curious 
what that something special is.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:55.570
Yes.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.820
But even Papa said he didn't know.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.780
<i>Even royalty doesn't know?</i>

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:05.740
Lady Olivia, do you know 
anything about this tree?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:10.730
I can't discuss this tree, even with you two.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:12.960
So to put it another way,

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.750
it's something that important, then?

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.180
Speaking of the Sword King,

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:23.550
one of this school festival's main attractions 
is the Sword King Battle Tournament.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.600
I've already announced my participation.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.360
Well, well...

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:31.590
Looks like the champion's 
already been decided, then.

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:35.270
No, it's not yet guaranteed that I'll win.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.360
Because...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.050
you'll be participating, too.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:40.820
Huh?

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:45.570
I went ahead and submitted the form 
to announce your participation.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:50.830
But I'll be performing in the play.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.220
Surely you can do both, right?

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.860
Besides, I don't like showing off my power—

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.090
Enough!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.080
I don't care about your preferences.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.390
If you won't participate,

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:05.130
then I'll make my own decision 
and act on a certain matter.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.510
Are you okay with that?

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.510
<i>Th-This woman!</i>

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.320
I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.460
<b>The Greatest Demon Lord 
Is Reborn as a Typical Nobody</b>

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.530
<i>"The Erotic Maid Café."</i>

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.160
<i>I suppose that is very easy to understand,</i>

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:58.220
<i>but couldn't we have gone with 
a slightly vaguer name for it?</i>

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.170
Hey!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.250
Why, you!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.630
You just touched my butt, didn't you?!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.390
A perverted groper deserves 
to be sentenced to death!

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.390
Please let me handle this.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.330
You went too far.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.710
Boo.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.230
Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:31.740
Please don't say such a thing!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.950
Please let us offer you our hospitality!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:36.830
You should.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.900
A-All right.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.420
Just for a little bit, then.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.180
Welcome back, Master!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.270
What would you like today?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:07:01.100
A drink? A meal? Or perhaps... me?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.440
Today, I would recommend me!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.570
Me, too!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.730
No, me!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.940
Pick me instead!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.940
I'd like a drink, please.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.780
One orange juice.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.910
What are you doing?!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.610
All while I was out patrolling?!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:19.200
I can't leave you alone for one second!

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:23.670
We're providing our service 
to Master. What of it?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.360
Service?!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.920
Oh, you don't need to force 
yourself, Miss Ireena.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.740
I can provide service just as well!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.850
Hmm, can you?

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.200
Where are you looking?!

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:48.010
I'll handle all the waiting 
and serving for Ard!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.030
All of you can back off!

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.180
That's tyranny, Miss Ireena!

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:55.520
Ardy is everyone's master!

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.610
Please, you have to understand that!

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.240
That's right, that's right!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.750
Argh, jeez, shut up!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.340
Ard is solely my master!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.270
Everyone, fighting is bad.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:11.350
So we'll compromise,
and I'll serve him for you!

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:15.260
No, Miss Sylphy, we would be 
grateful if you didn't do anything.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.840
<i>To everyone on campus...</i>

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.850
<i>The festival of swordsmanship honoring 
the spirit of Laville's third king,</i>

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:28.440
<i>the Sword King Battle Tournament, 
will be starting tomorrow!</i>

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:32.030
<i>For this year's 100th anniversary, 
the grand prize will be</i>

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.700
<i>a replica of his Holy Sword, Vald-Galgulus!</i>

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.240
I'm entering!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.710
I was just thinking about entering it, too.

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:43.360
You'll be in it, right, Ard?

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.960
Yes. Apparently so.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:46.680
Huh?

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.280
Th-Then maybe I should enter, too.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.690
If I go up against you, Ardy,

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:55.180
please use the match to 
give me an intimate lesson!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:09:00.180
You mean you just want to use it as an 
excuse to do naughty things, don't you?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.430
Such mistrust again!

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.000
That reminds me,

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.790
we never did settle our match 
during the last battle event.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.540
This time, I'll beat you black 
and blue, so prepare yourself!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.820
Come try me if you can, you horny succubus!

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.830
The Holy Sword, Vald-Galgulus...

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.990
Big Sis's sword...

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.510
Now, that time of year has come once again!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.420
It's the Sword King Battle Tournament!

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:38.550
Contestants can only use sword 
techniques and enhancement magic.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:42.810
Though this year, we have three exceptional 
people partaking in the tournament!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.350
Two of which are attending this very school!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:49.440
Everyone knows of the 
children of the Great Heroes!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.770
My heart's racing with anticipation!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.170
And the last one is none other!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.650
Yay!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:10:00.780
The living legend! The founder and 
pinnacle of all swordsmanship!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:05.460
One of the Top Four Heavenly Kings! 
Lady Olivia vel Vine!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.790
Is it really her?

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.340
They get to challenge that master swordsman?!

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.670
Huh? What about me?

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.200
Hey, what about me?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.630
Do I not count among those three?

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.420
Well, cheer up.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.750
I'm sure something good 
will happen to you someday.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.970
Sniffle...

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.280
Now, the eight strongest 
contenders who conquer

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.540
the preliminary round of the tournament 
will advance to the final rounds!

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.830
I-I yield.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.130
If I lose here, she'll 
think I lost on purpose.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.260
If I'm going to lose, it should 
be in the final rounds.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:03.760
It's the final match of preliminary block eight 
in the Sword King Battle Tournament!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.140
Once the winner of this match is decided,

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.390
we'll have our eight contenders 
moving on to the finals!

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:10.100
Final match...

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.560
That just leaves Ginny.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.860
Her opponent is a favorite 
to win, alongside Lady Olivia.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.590
<i>Not good. She'll lose, at this rate.</i>

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:48.850
<i>Being anxious will take away 
even her faint chance to win.</i>

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.750
Miss Ginny!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:54.910
It's still too early in the fight to give up!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.820
Keep your hopes up and face 
him until the very end!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.130
That's the match!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.250
An unexpected comeback!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:23.970
The winner is this nameless woman of talent!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:29.060
Ginny Fin de Salvan!

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:34.320
Ireena, Sylphy,

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.190
could you hurry back to our café?

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:38.150
We're short-handed.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.450
Sure.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.920
Of course.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.570
Later, then.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.390
Yes.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.130
Ardy!

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.410
You did well.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.430
Yeah.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:52.170
Huh?

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.810
Where are Miss Ireena and Miss Sylphy?

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.540
They returned to the café.

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:59.750
Is that so?

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:00.730
Huh?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.410
"The Miss & Mister Beauty Contest"?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.100
I suppose that's all right.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.970
Then, please come with me!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.770
No, I have to patrol.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:18.490
Lots of people will be at the 
Miss & Mister Beauty Contest,

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:20.270
so wouldn't that count as patrolling?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:24.980
Besides, I want you to come watch me, Ardy.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.390
Is that so bad?

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.660
A-All right...

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:36.390
<i>She's right.</i>

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:37.780
<i>There are a lot of people here.</i>

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:38.880
<i>Hm?</i>

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.840
<i>Where have I...?</i>

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.160
<i>Oh yeah, him!</i>

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:51.010
<i>Is he here for Ginny?</i>

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:55.980
Entry number 18! Miss Lilith takes the stage!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.670
Lilly!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:08.050
Lilith! Lilith! Lilly!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.800
Excuse me, are you by chance...

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.050
Mister Elraldo?

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:08.530
Huh?!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.990
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.710
<i>Though his appearance has... 
significantly changed.</i>

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.260
I had heard that you were holed up

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:24.420
in your dorm room ever since 
the commotion around our duel.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.110
I-I haven't done anything wrong!

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.110
It's true!

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:32.890
S-So... please don't kill me!

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.680
Why are you here?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:39.010
I-I just came to watch L-L-Lilly.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:39.900
That's all.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:42.860
Ah, Lilly...

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.190
Now, next up is entry number 19, Miss Ginny!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.540
Ginny's taking the stage?

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.620
I see. So she's changed, then.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.130
One could say the same about you.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.590
Ever since that day when she met you,

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.300
she's grown stronger and 
improved things for herself.

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:11.400
Compared to her, I haven't changed at all.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.260
<i>No, you've changed plenty.</i>

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:21.540
Ginny's family has had the duty of serving 
and protecting my family for generations.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.310
So when we were children,

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:28.320
Ginny was always at my side as my guardian.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.360
But she was always bad at everything 
she did when she was young.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.330
It made me feel like I had to be 
the one to protect her instead.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.820
Yet, even though I felt that way, 
I got frustrated at how slow she was.

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:42.540
So that's why you did what you did?

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.720
That wasn't the only reason.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:49.060
My father was constantly telling me 
to act like a duke's eldest son.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:52.900
I was raised being told to think 
of everyone below royalty as ants.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:56.760
That was incredibly stressful for me...

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:03.480
So to escape from it, I began 
insulting and bullying Ginny.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.490
But because of what I've done,

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:10.940
I've left a curse of inferiority on 
her heart that still hasn't lifted.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.910
It might not mean much 
to say, coming from me,

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.870
but I'm relieved.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.000
Relieved?

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:25.960
Because you beat me back then, 
she's gained the chance to change.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:30.440
There's no doubt that her 
curse is halfway gone now.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.920
So I'm relieved.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.310
Then what about the curse on you?

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.760
Think you'll break that curse 
of guilt and self-loathing?

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:45.480
That's something I'll probably 
bear for the rest of my life.

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:49.000
I haven't even managed 
to apologize to her yet.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.840
I need to be able to face her with 
sincerity, bow my head properly,

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.580
and atone for what I've done.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:59.030
I doubt my curse will be broken 
until I'm finally able to do that.

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.450
But I'm afraid to face her.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.040
I doubt you'd be able to 
understand these feelings.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.120
That's not true.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:11.170
I bear a similar burden myself.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:15.880
<i>I still haven't been able to 
tell Sylphy about that yet...</i>

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:22.830
I thought you were an unpleasant 
man who just had it all,

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.890
but I guess you've suffered, too?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.950
Looks like the contest's 
results are already decided.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.760
A guy like me shouldn't stay here any longer.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:46.740
This year's winners are class 1-C's
 Miss Ginny and Mister Ard!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.160
So cute!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.350
I wish the guy beside her would die.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.260
Hey!

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:56.460
My, I never thought I'd actually win!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.970
Does this mean I'm actually 
a little attractive?

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.920
More than just a little.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:05.180
You can hold your head 
high as the winner today.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:08.470
I guarantee you that, Miss Ginny.

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:13.020
Though it's not like I have any 
authority to back that guarantee.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.620
Really?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.740
You really think so?

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.220
You truly are a lovely woman.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:24.950
So have confidence in yourself.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.220
Thank you so much.

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:32.250
I think I might be able to 
like myself a little more.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.880
Oh! Ginny's back!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.840
Congratulations on winning the contest!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.600
Huh?

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.810
What an incredible amount of customers.

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.330
It's so full of customers.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.880
Looks like our advertising 
has already paid off.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:56.360
You're late—ahh!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.800
I wanted to enter that contest, too!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:00.820
Not fair!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.130
Now, it's time for the third match!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:11.790
It's no exaggeration to say 
this is the real final battle!

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:16.420
The living legend is already 
facing the number one rookie!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.750
<i>This is what I least wanted to happen.</i>

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.470
<i>It's hard to hold back so 
I don't give myself away.</i>

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.470
Shall we play around again, 
my foolish little brother?!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:41.150
<i>It would be too unnatural if 
I lost without doing anything!</i>

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.630
Interesting.

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:44.890
Don't die on me now!

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.450
Hey, Ardy!

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:51.160
An arena is no place to put on an act!

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:53.920
<i>Not good! She's serious!</i>

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.420
Reflect Mega Wall!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:03.840
You can't do that.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.670
That's against the rules!

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:05.710
Ah, he did it now.

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:07.420
Don't come back again!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.560
Lady Olivia!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.560
<i>Ahh, I went too far...</i>

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:17.030
<i>In the end, I was disqualified 
for using prohibited magic.</i>

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:20.530
<i>Olivia didn't make it back in 
time for her match and forfeited.</i>

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:26.370
This next match is between the daughter of 
the Heroic Baron and our no-name dark horse!

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.330
Big Sis!

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:30.330
Do your best out there!

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:33.290
I won't lose to the likes of you!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.000
Don't get full of yourself!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.210
I'll never lose to someone

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:42.740
who dares to monopolize Ardy for herself!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.140
What is this harem nonsense?!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:54.390
I'm the only one allowed to be with Ard!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:57.440
If you think of him as more than a friend,

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.020
then why don't you just come out and say it?!

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:00.450
Huh? What?

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.400
Harem?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.240
What's with this match?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.160
Is Ard the guy from earlier?

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:06.130
Take this seriously!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.850
<i>Will this match end soon?</i>

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:07.700
<i>Please...</i>

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.550
The winner is Ireena!

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:32.780
Now we've settled who belongs beside Ard!

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:35.600
Huh? What are you saying?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.180
Just because you won in swordsmanship?

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:41.360
That was a splendid battle, both of you.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.580
You did it, Big Sis!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.710
Anyway, I'll be the one at Ard's side!

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:49.500
Absolutely not!

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.000
Good grief.

00:21:55.640 --> 00:22:02.210
Nothing is more useless than actors 
who won't follow their script.

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:05.000
This will cause the outcome to change.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.860
And we can't have that.
